{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6e0a37ad52139dc984107608d807c5b80f11b881e9f97e9a6aff7c7cd0f28f2a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_a:2_4_046_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5af56e7e7b9cf36f16fcae2b7640cc7f8be16f289be49bbc6395ddf7a9f8f484",
      "text": "喂喂。我有件事，\n无论如何都想向●●●●プロデューサー汇报。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_a:2_4_046_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4391c0d5ab462d991a4b3e4a815336fc97eea0c73207d64f30e4ebe39c312f83",
      "text": "并不是什么急事，如果您正忙的话，\n改日再说也可以……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_a:2_4_046_01_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eac45b6855021e10962477f5af1f545f3e25f3d1397bf8a1a1c5c53306cfe0cc",
      "text": "没关系的哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_a:2_4_046_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60fe920ada440e349c26bd1be067e2dd3145f30e3052c357b1adf5521c650041",
      "text": "谢谢您！前阵子在节分的工作中聊过天的那对母子，寄了一封信过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_a:2_4_046_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4be3d9782881c08de0fd59aeb0be3751dd3ccbe0cacce6abfa261a06eed4f1c1",
      "text": "信中写满了感谢的话语，说听了我的讲解后，\n对节分有了更深入的了解。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_a:2_4_046_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c012313185481e1b134c7b39e14d13fe8ca2d43cdac029ba30ac6e375c18557",
      "text": "而且，他们好像也看到海报了。虽然被恶鬼的模样吓了一跳，但觉得非常帅气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_a:2_4_046_01_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a66c4632bcf6cd9b29b180fb1507e965f77801641ed96328d57068c3b3a1c988",
      "text": "能够像这样直接收到道谢的言辞……\n我真的感到无比欣慰！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_a:2_4_046_01_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c67a26ebde53f0f585708099c3da3e0f4f4dfccf3f5b7e3547c509dc55a96619",
      "text": "真是段佳话呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_a:2_4_046_01_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3055e91d0d4102a2a155d3a58aba21c21acdbee2a8f571ff52913d326ce0072",
      "text": "太好了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_a:2_4_046_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a696114433431aa4e16d04511a6009d250b1750592450708ef003a38aefafd5",
      "text": "是的！真是一次最棒的体验。\n要是还能接到那样的工作就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_a:2_4_046_01_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b42238f61edbe0a374a0c66efff9f92b440ff98af943de68ccb58e73c72e74b",
      "text": "哎呀，不知不觉说了这么长，真是不好意思。\n那就先聊到这里。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
